<section class="av_textblock_section av-m7xp8rwo-19e6c48455cbae4493fe26e619ed3642" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>The Casa Privee Philosophy, established by our Founder and CEO, <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bankole_Johnson" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Bankole A. Johnson, DSc, MD, MBChB, MPhil, DFAPA, FRCPsych, ABPM, ABSCP, ABDA, FACFEI</a>, is that achieving complete wellness for our patients and clients is essential to their happiness, wellness, and health, and will slow the effects of aging on the mind and body.</p>
</div></section>
<div class="hr av-12wrmk6-ae54f0503f4351ae4e921327d07187f1 hr-custom avia-builder-el-28 el_after_av_textblock avia-builder-el-last hr-center hr-icon-no"><span class="hr-inner inner-border-av-border-fat"><span class="hr-inner-style"></span></span></div></div><div class="flex_column_table av-m7xpb3ka-ecd3b698a6e361ac0e79809c849a30d2 sc-av_one_half av-equal-height-column-flextable"><div class="flex_column av-m7xpb3ka-ecd3b698a6e361ac0e79809c849a30d2 av_one_half avia-builder-el-29 el_after_av_one_full el_before_av_one_half first flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="avia-image-container av-4vg9au-d098227fe404bcfeeb598feaa9f61917 av-styling- avia-align-center avia-builder-el-30 avia-builder-el-no-sibling" itemprop="image" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/ImageObject"><div class="avia-image-container-inner"><div class="avia-image-overlay-wrap"><img alt="Examples of Our Practice Areas and Services" class="wp-image-1381 avia-img-lazy-loading-not-1381 avia_image" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" height="450" itemprop="thumbnailUrl" sizes="(max-width: 576px) 100vw, 576px" src="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Examples-of-Our-Practice-Areas-and-Services.webp" srcset="<?php echo $basePath; ?>wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Examples-of-Our-Practice-Areas-and-Services.webp 576w, ../wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Examples-of-Our-Practice-Areas-and-Services-300x234.webp 300w" title="Patient and staff in our treatment room at Casa Privee in Miami Florida getting ready for a customized treatment program." width="576"/></div></div></div></div><div class="av-flex-placeholder"></div><div class="flex_column av-3u0is6-ea181aa0383dad61b8606ef656306a33 av_one_half avia-builder-el-31 el_after_av_one_half avia-builder-el-last mobile-text flex_column_table_cell av-equal-height-column av-align-top column-top-margin"><div class="av-special-heading av-m7xpam2e-67a26fe7a6e4440e20d581627bd30586 av-special-heading-h4 custom-color-heading blockquote modern-quote avia-builder-el-32 el_before_av_textblock avia-builder-el-first av-inherit-size"><h4 class="av-special-heading-tag" itemprop="headline">It Begins with Knowing and Understanding You</h4><div class="special-heading-border"><div class="special-heading-inner-border"></div></div></div>
<section class="av_textblock_section av-m7xpauad-7c8389ffaba2961a8c30e5a46e9b3097" itemscope="itemscope" itemtype="https://schema.org/CreativeWork"><div class="avia_textblock av_inherit_color" itemprop="text"><p>For you to achieve complete wellness, we must form a deep connection and understanding of you and your needs. Each of us is different, and our desires, goals, and dreams are personal and unique.</p>
<p><strong><em>Our exceptional health and addiction care providers understand that an intimate understanding brings a spiritual element to enter treatments as you progress through different milestones.</em></strong></p>
<p>You will instantly see how our approach differs vastly from the care you receive from a conventional medical practice. Our patient care is supported by a state-of-the-art, high-technology practice.</p>
</div></section></div></div><!--close column table wrapper. Autoclose: 1 -->
